WEBVTT

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:06.630
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.840
The gravitational field has changed!
The Ryvius is at the center of a sphere...

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.440
...with a radius of 20 serades,
with the Ryvius in its core!

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.710
The towed alley intervention measure is
also reacting. The numbers are rising!

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.550
Deviation is also increasing!

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:24.210
Outer wall is cracked in 230 sections!

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.580
They've passed the defense shield,
at 67 million anvils!

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:32.090
This phenomenon...!

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:34.100
Cylinder gravitational field
active faults are forming...

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.460
...as a result of the great force
of the gravitational field.

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:38.530
We've been trapped in
a gravitational field?

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:39.860
Can't we get outta here?

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:41.940
If we tried to force our way out...

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:45.170
...we'd exceed our Roche limit, the ship
would undergo enormous twisting force.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.330
The Ryvius could not avoid being crushed.

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:49.770
Another... similar type of ship.

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:54.940
We can't get out, and we haven't
even seen the enemy! No way!

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:58.920
I don't wanna die!

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:15.630
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:23.210
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:27.220
Although loneliness...

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:31.550
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:38.790
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:43.870
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.830
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:54.370
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:58.150
...the dream and the reality...

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:01.780
...that you saw cross paths

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:05.480
Some light is shed...

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:10.060
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:17.290
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:25.300
The things I want have no shape

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:33.710
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.860
Incomprehensible

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:01.500
Why are you alone
wearing that heavy outfit?

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.140
Never mind. Let's hurry!

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:04.970
Are you that afraid to get beat up again?

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:08.910
<i>Has the Lift ship been influenced</i>
<i>by the gravitational field?</i>

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.880
No. We've completed
our approach process.

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:14.580
Please proceed to detach the Lift ship.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.790
<i>Wait a minute! If we get</i>
<i>any closer to the fault...</i>

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:20.350
<i>... even the Vital Guarder will exceed</i>
<i>its Roche limit and end up in pieces!</i>

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:23.860
But the enemy's not gonna ignore
us after trapping us like this!

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:26.590
Hey! Those are Captain's orders!
Abort take off!

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:29.400
I'm not about to let the enemy torture
us and not do anything to prevent it.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:30.470
Yuki!

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:33.460
Kouji! The enemy's attacking!
We're facing a crisis!

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:35.810
This isn't the time to be taking
things easy! You be quiet!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.270
Ikumi...!

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:40.810
We can assume that the enemy's
attack has already commenced.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.280
- Juli! Give us orders!
- Hurry!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.150
At this rate, we'll be
pulverized by the deadweight.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.020
Develop a field to push away
the ship's surrounding...!

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:51.320
And then... we must figure out
how to escape... somehow...!

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:53.190
It's useless, Ms. Good Girl.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:56.430
<i>Just hurry up and</i>
<i>disconnect the Lift ship!</i>

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:57.830
Shall we?

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:00.460
Yeah, do it! I'm sure they'll do
something about this situation!

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:01.730
But...!

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.770
Please, Heigar. Do it!

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:08.880
<i>Very well.</i>

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:10.570
Also give us both Barge Cannons.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.950
We may need them,
depending on how the enemy attacks!

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:15.050
The Ryvius and the Lift ship
will be linked by wire...

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:17.050
...for position confirmation
and communication!

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:18.880
<i>Lift ship separating in 12 minutes.</i>

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:21.250
<i>Don't forget to develop a field,</i>
<i>so you won't get crushed.</i>

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:24.020
We're sending the Vital Guarder
out in 20 minutes!

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:25.660
That's impossible!

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.790
I've already sent through
an automatic Approach Solid.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.200
Skip the confirmation procedures.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.800
We'll point ourselves toward the enemy's
estimated course, upon lift off.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.070
Reprogramming system flow to
enable data transfers.

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:36.570
Releasing outer layer block.

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:40.740
System flow, 87 percent of standard.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:43.610
Friction factor, decreased by 12 percent.

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:45.080
Temperature increase, 0.8 points.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.270
<i>Kouji!</i>

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:49.410
<i>Hang in there, Kouji. Together, you</i>
<i>and the Vital Guarder will prevail.</i>

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:51.870
Not a chance.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.390
<i>Gamma ray burst confirmed.</i>

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:56.580
<i>Gravitational field has</i>
<i>completely surrounded the enemy.</i>

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:58.220
That was too easy.

00:04:58.220 --> 00:05:01.460
Their ship is the same type as ours.
Won't they be able to break through?

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:05.390
Of the Vaia ships, Dicastia has the
greatest output of gravitational waves.

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.500
All we need to do now is
torture them with Eysfina.

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:11.530
We'll begin bombarding the target
as soon as we enter firing range.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.500
Hurry up!

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:16.730
You girls are so slow, you barely reach
a decent pace when you rush things!

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:23.080
<i>A message to all on board.</i>

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:26.180
<i>The Ryvius is about to enter a
<i>battle against the enemy ship.</i></i>

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:28.660
<i>As safety measures for the</i>
<i>unlikely event of being hit...</i>

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.930
<i>... the partitions of sections near the outer</i>
<i>walls will be closed in five minutes.</i>

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.260
<i>Please evacuate these areas at once.</i>

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:35.260
Whatever you say, Miss Faina.

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:38.500
- The enemy ship is the same as the Ryvius.
- You're kidding. The same type of ship?

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.900
- <i>People in the danger zones are asked...</i>
- Hey! This isn't good!

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.630
- <i>... to evacuate at once. I repeat...</i>
- Who cares where we evacuate to?

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:44.840
Yeah! When we die,
we're all dying together!

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.670
- I don't wanna die with you guys!
- Why not?

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:51.440
Pat. I think this place is unsafe.
We shall escape from here at once.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:53.210
To where?

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:54.610
Somewhere!

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:02.080
Ikumi...!

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:08.420
Oh, no...!

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:11.670
- What do you think you're doing?
- You're so clumsy!

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:14.790
Clean that up right away.
The battle's about to begin!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.760
How dare you look at us like that!

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:21.100
I apologize! I was mistaken!

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:22.980
You don't understand the situation!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.540
I'll win tomorrow!

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:25.740
You <i>really</i> don't understand!

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:31.920
The prayers of Aisha.
A soul deeper than mercy.

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:35.510
This ordeal shall be the same light as
the stars gathered under the name of Mars.

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:39.790
Charlotte... I'll protect you!

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:44.260
I'm afraid. I'm so afraid.

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:47.170
It'll be all right.
The Vital Guarder's taking off.

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:50.170
Really? I'm so relieved!

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:53.000
Who in the hell is that?

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:04.620
<i>Lift ship has completed</i>
<i>its separation from the Ryvius.</i>

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.980
<i>Finished transferring</i>
<i>Lift Off Approach Solid.</i>

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:22.330
<i>Heigar! Give me the Barge Cannons</i>
<i>immediately upon lift off!</i>

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:25.630
<i>Purging Barge Cannon.</i>
<i>Are you fine with that?</i>

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:27.740
<i>Y- Yes.</i>

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:31.480
<i>Please purge.</i>
<i>But avoid anything too dangerous.</i>

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:33.050
The present situation is dangerous!

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.540
Focus on your duties!

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.280
Commencing separation, north side,
arresting blocks A to F!

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:41.620
Commencing separation, south side,
arresting blocks A to F!

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:45.090
Field strength, 120 points!

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.090
Acceleration 12.5!

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:50.260
Release the BB-3 Solid.
We'll attract the Barge Cannon!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:56.000
Barge Cannon spherometer engaged!
Transfer to team riding and begin approach.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:00.710
The velocity of the Barge is steady
and we are perfectly aligned.

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:04.110
- How many shots left in the cannon?
- Barge West has 11, and East has 8!

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:05.300
That's not much!

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:09.780
We shot too many earlier.

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:12.190
So now we've attached the weapons.
What do you plan to fire it at?

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:14.790
- Fire at the enemy's estimated route.
- But our radar's not working.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:16.760
Sure we can do it?

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:23.300
We're fighting a battle without vision.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.530
What do you think the
enemy will do next?

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.700
- That's obvious.
- Torture us from a distance.

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:35.480
<i>The power field is showing changes in</i>
<i>a section of the gravitational fault.</i>

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:36.580
At what point?

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.770
Phi 34, zeta minus 03, gamma 8!

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:41.710
That's way off our estimate!

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:42.770
The Ryvius is...!

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:49.350
- We've been hit!
- What's the damage report?

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:51.320
Section 564, portside.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:54.860
They're attacking us using the
gravitational field active faults.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.700
They're firing items of small
volume at high speeds to...!

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.570
From the opposite side now?

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:04.970
Is there any way to counter?

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:08.700
Shut up, damn it! I haven't received
the East Control Solid yet!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.510
A malfunction in the server?
Kouji! Go and check it out!

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:13.750
My hands are full!

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:16.610
R-Right. I'll go.

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:22.720
You're so kind.

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:23.980
I try to be attentive.

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:27.060
- <i>We're hit again!</i>
- <i>Section 192!</i>

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:30.400
- <i>What is it?</i>
- <i>There's a display that indicates...</i>

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:32.730
<i>... a terminal in section 192 has</i>
<i>been abruptly disconnected.</i>

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:36.860
- <i>There were people there?</i>
- <i>But 192 is right by the outer wall!</i>

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:38.800
<i>Why hadn't they evacuated?</i>

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:40.670
Blast it!

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:45.200
People... people died? People?

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:52.050
- Don't do it!
- Bastards!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.400
Not even our Barge Cannon works?

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:09.830
Of course not.
This is the extent of our Roche.

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:12.640
That's why I said we needed
to recruit additional workers!

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:14.770
The output of the backup
power supply isn't increasing.

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:17.140
Quickly confirm damages to the ship!

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:19.700
People... have died...!

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:22.410
All because of me.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:24.720
Juli, isn't there any way outta this?

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:26.520
You're the Captain.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:28.950
Come on. But I'm trying.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.590
A report on a scuffle on board!
A request is made for assistance.

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:34.260
We haven't got time for that!

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:38.930
<i>Help! Someone! It's me!</i>
<i>Lucson Houjou of Zwei!</i>

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:41.420
- <i>Lucson!</i>
- <i>Ah, no! Not there!</i>

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.440
<i>I'm Zwei's training leader!</i>

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:44.700
<i>Let go of Lucson!</i>

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:47.900
Pat! Someone, get them some help!

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:50.440
What are you saying at a time like this?

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.850
What are you doing, Ikumi?

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.020
It's that girl again. But why?

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:15.900
Blue.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:28.240
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:33.180
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:54.970
Do something, Lift ship!

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:56.670
<i>We'll be destroyed at this rate!</i>

00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:58.800
<i>No way! This can't be happening!</i>

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:01.940
<i>Don't get so emotional. Take rational</i>
<i>measures against what is happening.</i>

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.240
<i>How can you be so calm?!</i>

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.710
<i>Don't worry. With the Ryvius</i>
<i>and the Vital Guarder!</i>

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:09.420
- <i>What are you saying?</i>
- <i>Hurry up and save us!</i>

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.990
<i>Hey, are you listening, Lift ship?</i>

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.260
<i>Kouji? Lkumi? It's your</i>
<i>job to do something!</i>

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:15.820
The Zwei are made up of <i>these</i> guys?

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:21.190
I've had enough of you bastards!

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:23.060
Yuki!

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:26.410
<i>You guys out there are</i>
<i>living without a care!</i>

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.780
<i>You force everything upon others,</i>
<i>and hope for the best?</i>

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:29.610
Yuki?

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.570
You guys don't do anything,
yet consistently make claims.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:35.380
And you actually think you've
accomplished something by doing so.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.580
<i>Well you're missing the point!</i>
<i>You guys haven't done a thing!</i>

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:41.310
<i>You guys are no different</i>
<i>from being dead!</i>

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:44.210
<i>So I don't wanna hear such people</i>
<i>giving out orders like hotshots!</i>

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:48.260
<i>I'm gonna do as I wish.</i>
<i>I don't wanna hear any complaints, got that?</i>

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:55.360
Your boyfriend sure has told us off.

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:57.290
That wasn't Ikumi!

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:00.340
How should we know?
After all, we're fools, right?

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:01.440
That's right!

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:05.670
But you're right. Your boyfriend couldn't
have pulled off something so damn cool.

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:11.980
You girls haven't shown the least
bit of gratitude toward Ikumi!

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:14.980
You don't understand!
You <i>are</i> fools!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:19.290
I don't want to be
called a fool by you.

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:29.330
Cullen! Develop the expansion
field in the direction of the Ryvius!

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:31.560
Don't blame me, whatever happens.

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:35.680
What's the big idea?

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.580
I told you, I'm doing as I wish!

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:38.980
You've gotta be outta your mind!

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:42.010
Stop! Right now, we've got
no choice but to rely on him!

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:55.880
I get it! Direct a compressed
gravity field at the enemy's field.

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.000
But we only have an instant!

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.360
That's why I'm giving you the
time to do what you need to.

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:04.960
Okay. As long as we can save everyone.

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:07.570
Everyone, be prepared for an impact!

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:10.840
<i>We're gonna create a tear in the field,</i>
<i>and send the Vital Guarder through it!</i>

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:12.850
Hey, you can't be serious!

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:14.810
Kouji! What about the Barge Cannons?

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:16.820
We'll need 'em right away.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:19.370
<i>Kouji? Kouji!</i>

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:27.390
Blue!

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:31.760
Are you my enemy?

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:36.160
Come with us!

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.270
Let go of me!

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.170
G-Girls. Stop it.

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:42.180
You wanna come too?

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:44.270
We don't mind one bit.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:46.910
Reiko!

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:49.970
Reiko, help me! Please, Reiko!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:51.980
Help!

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:53.710
REIKO!

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:57.620
I wonder if the people of
section 192 really died.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:00.420
Who cares whether they did or not.
As long as it's safe here.

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:01.890
That's true.

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:03.960
Hey, what are we having
for dinner tonight?

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.200
You're not expecting us to
buy you dinner again, are you?

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.700
Okay, checkmate!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:09.370
Huh? Hey, wait a minute.

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:10.360
Nope, too late!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.700
You fool!

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.220
You're such a coward to make advances
to Charlotte when she's most vulnerable!

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:29.520
It's all your fault! Your fault!

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:32.020
The gamma ray burst intensity
is rising dramatically.

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:34.120
Are they by chance trying to break
through a crack in the field?

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:35.960
That's too dangerous! Stop them!

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:38.430
But that's our only chance.

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:49.010
Kouji? What's going on? Hey!

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.210
We'll deal with the cannons later.

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:52.700
We don't have time to waste
if we're gonna save everyone!

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.650
- Now, Yuki!
- I know!

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:13.900
What is that?

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:16.330
Disruptions are appearing in the Finafield!

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:21.370
We must protect them! No matter
what it takes, we'll protect them!

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:32.750
They're coming in.

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:36.150
Many... many... are coming in.

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:40.980
What? What is this? What's this?

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:43.860
What's this? What's this?

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:58.530
- Pinger reacting! Got it!
- A separation type?

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.340
Kouji? Kouji!
What's up with Barge East?

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:06.050
Why's it taking so long?

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:08.320
Forget it! I'll create it here!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:11.550
- I've got the one for manual aim!
- Send it over right away!

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:23.430
<i>The Eysfina is docking,</i>
<i>for puppet wire recovery!</i>

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:26.070
Make it stop! They could
target them all with one shot!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:26.970
But...!

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:29.460
If we can't, fire all
bullets at once! Hurry!

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:32.210
Impossible. The percentage
of severed puppet wires is...!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:33.510
Then bring back the Eysteral!

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:36.070
The time you take doing things,
a kitty could do a better job!

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:40.020
Solid transferred.

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.010
Target approaching!
20 seconds before it reaches us!

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:47.290
Even so...

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:48.630
This'll...!

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:49.900
...I...

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.530
Finish it off!

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:53.500
...continue to live.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:06.010
The Eysteral has been destroyed!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:08.370
Enemy fire hit main output source!
Unable to navigate!

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:11.350
Do something!

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:13.480
You're all youngsters!

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:26.290
Towed array... decreasing.

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.830
Gravitational faults are disappearing.

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:32.490
D-Did we win?

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:35.040
Looks like it.

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:37.510
That Vital Guarder is some monster.

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:43.040
What's incredible are the people
on it. They're unbelievable.

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:48.880
<i>Ikumi Oze. Yuki Aiba.</i>

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:51.860
All right!

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:54.690
We did it, Akihiro! We're awesome!

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:57.100
Yuki!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:59.760
- You're really something!
- S-Stop it!

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:02.230
Let me at least thank you.

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:04.530
Boy, am I glad you're here! Right?

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:08.570
- You saved us.
- Yeah.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.570
Thank you, Yuki Aiba.

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:17.480
Well, you weren't so bad either!

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.360
You're one of us now!

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:27.260
I never agreed to that.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:30.590
Oops. I'm jealous of a guy.

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:42.310
I apologize for leaving my post.

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:45.480
Damn you!

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:51.610
With your abilities, you could've
taken control over this situation.

00:19:52.380 --> 00:19:54.350
Why didn't you do anything?

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:57.560
You're overrating me.

00:19:57.560 --> 00:20:00.090
I just happened to
become a Zwei member...

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:02.060
...and just happened to take the top seat.

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:06.060
I cannot be relied upon
with people's lives.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.170
Is that so.

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:15.640
Why do you continue to live
like you have no worries?

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:23.650
I-Ikumi...!

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:26.320
Kouji.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:30.380
Yuki's right this time. Honestly,
I thought you were better than this.

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:33.120
We were all about to die.

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.070
Why should a guy like that
have unlimited points?

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:51.570
Kozue? Kozue? The battle's over.

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:54.210
Let's go and greet Ikumi and the others.

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:01.640
If you use too much water,
you'll be deducted of all your points!

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.630
What's wrong Kozue.

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:09.320
No. Don't look.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:12.260
K-Kozue!

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:13.730
I said don't look.

00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:18.200
Kozue. How'd you get those wounds?

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:21.630
Don't look!

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:25.770
DON'T LOOK!

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:34.580
And still, we continue...

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:41.460
...to live, until we die.

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:12.650
In your dry eyes...

00:22:12.650 --> 00:22:17.720
...a silhouette appears

00:22:17.720 --> 00:22:22.420
The blue colored future...

00:22:22.420 --> 00:22:29.160
...swayed and glittered

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:38.570
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:38.570 --> 00:22:47.180
...freedom out of pity

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:55.620
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:55.620 --> 00:22:59.530
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:59.530 --> 00:23:05.900
goodbye

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:11.560
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:11.560 --> 00:23:13.590
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: Smiling with You
I'm thinking about you...

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:15.690
Next episode: Smiling with You
...so much about you.

00:23:15.690 --> 00:23:18.300
Next episode: Smiling with You
Right now, are you sad?

00:23:18.300 --> 00:23:21.930
Next episode: Smiling with You
Happy? Lonely?

00:23:21.930 --> 00:23:26.170
Next episode: Smiling with You
I don't know.
That's why I think about you.

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:30.040
Next episode: Smiling with You
I think about how I can look into your eyes,
and smile with you.
